{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-29T06:11:55.600Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7f8557ee791cd266194a12fb","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/5","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-29T06:11:55.600Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Behavioral revert proof used a disposable non-git copy, never the reviewed checkout. The fixed baseline passed both selected regressions; removing only StreamingCSVParser.appendField allocation guards made the field/record resource test fail, and disabling only importCSV admission dispatch made the late-invalid-row zero-write test fail. Restoring each implementation made its selected regression pass again. The reviewed source hashes stayed unchanged. Refreshed overlap against the public 2026.10.28 SDK found only in-memory mutation parsing/document resolution, no streaming admission surface; sibling package and upstream issue searches found no duplicate contract. Final read-only public tracker measurement: 133 items and exact rows, 46572 CSV bytes, zero invalid rows, maximum field width 2946 code units, mutation upper bound 133, 52 ms, 44049096 bytes observed heap; all copied file hashes unchanged."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-29T06:11:55.600Z"}],"before_hash":"2313e44245ad5aa6da1738772e1eba27111ba391ef79fe7893229956af46309b","after_hash":"700712ce9b3a81f6070c98a4f38a7bd38824ab291fab13b8da9efb0121d59382","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_versio